#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/storage_management.rst:41
msgid ""
"The script looks for thefirst entry that contains the UID(or a stripped "
"version of the UID). These entries arestable identifiersthat point to the"
" actual Linux block device."
